        Bitcoin dominance is currently <strong>59.04%</strong>, signaling continued large-cap leadership.
        <span class="hidden-text" id="moreSummary"> Institutional participation remains resilient as traders rotate selectively into high-liquidity altcoins with improving fundamentals.</span>
      </p>
      <button class="read-more" id="readMore">Read More</button>
    </section>

