      <h3>About CoinTracker Pro</h3>
      <p>A comprehensive cryptocurrency market data dashboard showing live prices, market caps, and trading volumes for thousands of digital assets to support informed trading decisions.</p>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <p>© 2026 CoinTracker Pro. Professional market intelligence for digital assets.</p>
    </footer>
